.TH "QRTOOL\-COMPLETION" "1" "2025-05-26" "qrtool 0.13.2" "General Commands Manual"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.nh
.ad l
.de URL
\fI\\$2\fP <\\$1>\\$3
..
.als MTO URL
.if \n[.g] \{\
.  mso www.tmac
.  am URL
